# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# L1 propose/notify — adopted: the language declares no L1-named
# meaning of its own (RVND's action_gate.py names L0/L2/L3/L5/L6, not L1/L4);
# this is the working meaning this layer adopts. Auto-releases, but carries an
# after-the-fact notify obligation on every action (AI Act Art. 14(4)(a):
# monitor operation) and is restricted to reversible effects: an action tagged
# `irreversible` is referred to a human overseer instead of auto-releasing.
actor agent grade L1
human overseer role overseer
gate  action risk high grade L1 grant agent
obligation notify-after-action on action
reserve  agent-action by overseer when tags contains irreversible
cord  agent  -> action
cord  action -> master
